    "body": "Hi @onnyyonn, I think this is going to be the same issue as #1780 (or at least they will have the same root cause). I think we have had similar issues with the spacing getting messed up for emoji with fish before and running the following fixed those issues\r\n```fish\r\nset -g fish_emoji_width 2\r\n```\r\nCan you try that and see if that helps?",
